<title>JAPAN: Russia '97 platinum group exports seen down-Almaz.</title>
<headline>Russia '97 platinum group exports seen down-Almaz.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian exports of platinum group metals are expected to be much lower in 1997 than in 1996 and no palladium will be exported to Japan in March, Y.F. Zhigulov, trade representative of the Russian Federation in Japan and representative of platinum group exporting agency Almazjuvelirexport (Almaz), said on Monday.</p>
</text>
